=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">影</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>影子；剪影；幻影</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かげ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">影</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">影子；轮廓；身影；倒影；映像；不祥之兆；凶兆；光；星光；月光；痕迹；往日风采的残影；背后；后面；另一侧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">影響</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">影响</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">撮影</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さつえい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摄影；拍摄；摄制；录像</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">松</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>松树</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">松</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">松树；（松竹梅三级中的）最高一级；上等</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">撃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>攻击；打击；击败；征服</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み<